Cell["\<\
Here an Asian call option is evaluated. 
The pricing methodology is MonteCarlo in this case. 
Exact value is 2.3682854518288..., obtained from convolution algorithm. 

One can specify the pricing methodology; the binomial tree method is also \
available. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5121067250622807`*^9, 3.5121067447963157`*^9}, {
